{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着人工智能快速發展，全球越來越多環保組織開始將AI納入日常工作流程，用於分析氣候數據、監測森林火災以及統計瀕危野生動物數量。然而，這些組織同時也是人工智能基礎設施擴張最堅定的批評者之一，因為支撐AI運行的數據中心正帶來不斷增長的能源消耗、用水需求和温室氣體排放問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585436.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.665312+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:38:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"557b070a21226b797fe379102cd512f861d64113873413f26cca89891d3ab71c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}